<title>UK: IBCA rates LW Rentenbank dual currency bond.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates LW Rentenbank dual currency bond.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Feb 27 - IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Thursday it had assigned a long-term rating of AAA to the Landwirtschaftliche Rentenbank 30 billion yen 4.9 percent dual currency bonds - first series (1997) issue due 2000.</p>
<p>The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of Landwirtschaftliche Rentenbank.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
